Subject: [PATCH] gdi.exe16: print queues, GetPath, aspect ratio filter, engine
 char widths

The spooler priority queues (CreatePQ, InsertPQ, MinPQ, ExtractPQ, SizePQ, DeletePQ) are real queues; GetPath16 and GetAspectRatioFilterEx16 call GDI32; EngineGetCharWidth fills every character; ignored calls no longer log FIXMEs.

Unverified: no 16 bit runtime or compiler is available here, so this is compile-checked only.

